@startuml
left to right direction
actor Engineer
actor "Independent reviewer" as Reviewer
actor "Field analyst" as Analyst
actor "Safety lead" as Lead
actor "Auditor / regulator" as Auditor
rectangle "Safeguard Assurance" {
  usecase "Create / revise candidate\nSubmit laboratory evidence" as Lab
  usecase "Approve limited deployment\nApprove expansion" as Decision
  usecase "Submit field evidence\nReport concern" as Field
  usecase "Close action independently" as Close
  usecase "Govern participant roles\nInspect escalations" as Govern
  usecase "Inspect / export review history" as Read
  usecase "Escalate overdue action" as Escalate
}
Engineer -- Lab
Reviewer -- Decision
Reviewer -- Close
Reviewer -- Field
Analyst -- Field
Lead -- Govern
Lead -- Field
Auditor -- Read
Auditor -- Escalate
note bottom of Escalate : Any address may trigger overdue escalation.\nReaders need no on-chain auditor role.\nRegulators are evidence recipients, not release approvers.
@enduml
